iving qualifying benefits, and patients with certain medical conditions. The test covers visual acuity, refraction, eye pressure measurement, and an examination of the internal and external structures of the eye."}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"Free (if eligible)"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500","children":"20-25 minutes"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4 text-center","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-success)]/10","children":["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-4 h-4 text-[var(--color-success)]","fill":"currentColor","viewBox":"0 0 20 20","children":["$","path",null,{"fillRule":"evenodd","d":"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z","clipRule":"evenodd"}]}]}]}]]}],["$","tr","1",{"className":"hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"Private Eye Test"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500","children":"A full eye examination for patients who do not qualify for NHS funding. The test includes all the same clinical checks as the NHS eye test — visual acuity, refraction, slit lamp examination, and ophthalmoscopy — providing a thorough assessment of your vision and eye health."}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"From £20"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500","children":"25-30 minutes"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4 t